  <div id="4f8635d4-2d6d-4f6b-b834-ef3f802985ba" data-sid="n" class="page-section"><section class="scheme-1 section section-medium"><div class="container"><div class="stack gap-element-xlarge"><div class="stack gap-element-small"><h2 data-cid="p" data-props='{"headingTag":"H2","headingSize":"H6","headingText":"teams already running our programs","contentHorizontalAlignment":"Center","maxWidth":"Default"}' class="heading-max-width heading-style-h6 align-center text-align-center" data-bind='{"text":"headingText"}'>teams already running our programs</h2></div><div style="display: contents"><div class="customer-logo-row align-items-center"><div class="customer-logo-wrapper r-r"><img class="customer-logo" src="/assets/a42045b9-a9be-42a7-8904-373303399676?v=tkt9g2" alt="" style="aspect-ratio: 120 / 56"></img></div><div class="customer-logo-wrapper r-s"><img class="customer-logo" src="/assets/186bcc12-eecb-47e7-8c17-42ff042e7c4c?v=tkt9g2" alt="" style="aspect-ratio: 120 / 56"></img></div><div class="customer-logo-wrapper r-t"><img class="customer-logo" src="/assets/fce0c8b6-e96d-4bde-8701-d68384039ed6?v=tkt9g2" alt="" style="aspect-ratio: 120 / 56"></img></div><div class="customer-logo-wrapper r-u"><img class="customer-logo" src="/assets/4286aea9-2364-4176-9a4c-2a5b5c05b597?v=tkt9g2" alt="" style="aspect-ratio: 120 / 56"></img></div><div class="customer-logo-wrapper r-v"><img class="customer-logo" src="/assets/033222bb-f193-455d-8ed1-c1af0f553b2c?v=tkt9g2" alt="" style="aspect-ratio: 120 / 56"></img></div><div class="customer-logo-wrapper r-w"><img class="customer-logo" src="/assets/8df0e2cf-d5ab-4b45-895c-4b41bbc4929b?v=tkt9g2" alt="" style="aspect-ratio: 120 / 56"></img></div><div class="customer-logo-wrapper r-x"><img class="customer-logo" src="/assets/90f61135-4bb0-40a3-8697-242de26fe3f4?v=tkt9g2" alt="" style="aspect-ratio: 120 / 56"></img></div></div></div></div></div></section></div>
  <div id="f31ca42f-d937-400e-a2cb-e48a1e64fc0a" data-sid="z" class="page-section"><section class="scheme-1 section"><div class="container"><div class="grid-column-2"><div class="stack fill-height stack-center"><div class="stack gap-element-tiny"><div class="row"><div class="tagline"><div>The Curalo difference</div></div></div><h2 data-cid="12" data-props='{"headingTag":"H2","headingSize":"H2","headingText":"Coaching with a personal touch","contentHorizontalAlignment":"Left","maxWidth":"Default"}' class="heading-style-h2 heading-max-width" data-bind='{"text":"headingText"}'>Coaching with a personal touch</h2></div><div class="stack gap-element-large"><div class="stack"><p data-cid="13" data-props='{"paragraphText":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"A Curalo trainer gets to know you — how you move, what motivates you and what your week actually looks like. That&#39;s what turns a workout into progress you stick with."}]}]},"paragraphSize":"Regular","textWeight":"Regular","contentHorizontalAlignment":"Left","textHeadingSize":"None","maxWidth":"Default"}' class="text-style-regular body-max-width" data-bind='{"text":"paragraphText"}'>A Curalo trainer gets to know you — how you move, what motivates you and what your week actually looks like. That's what turns a workout into progress you stick with.</p><div class="r-14"><ul class="icon-list body-max-width"><li class="icon-list-item"><span class="icon-wrapper icon-color icon-xsmall"><span style="line-height: 1; font-variation-settings: 'wght' var(--icon-weight), 'FILL' var(--icon-fill-axis), 'GRAD' 0, 'opsz' 24; font-family: var(--icon-font-family)">person</span></span><p data-cid="18" data-props='{"paragraphText":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"A dedicated coach who knows your goals"}]}]},"paragraphSize":"Regular","textWeight":"Regular","contentHorizontalAlignment":"Left","textHeadingSize":"None","maxWidth":"Default"}' class="text-style-regular body-max-width" data-bind='{"text":"paragraphText"}'>A dedicated coach who knows your goals</p></li><li class="icon-list-item"><span class="icon-wrapper icon-color icon-xsmall"><span style="line-height: 1; font-variation-settings: 'wght' var(--icon-weight), 'FILL' var(--icon-fill-axis), 'GRAD' 0, 'opsz' 24; font-family: var(--icon-font-family)">favorite</span></span><p data-cid="1b" data-props='{"paragraphText":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Care that goes beyond the session"}]}]},"paragraphSize":"Regular","textWeight":"Regular","contentHorizontalAlignment":"Left","textHeadingSize":"None","maxWidth":"Default"}' class="text-style-regular body-max-width" data-bind='{"text":"paragraphText"}'>Care that goes beyond the session</p></li><li class="icon-list-item"><span class="icon-wrapper icon-color icon-xsmall"><span style="line-height: 1; font-variation-settings: 'wght' var(--icon-weight), 'FILL' var(--icon-fill-axis), 'GRAD' 0, 'opsz' 24; font-family: var(--icon-font-family)">trending_up</span></span><p data-cid="1e" data-props='{"paragraphText":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Progress that&#39;s tracked, celebrated and adjusted"}]}]},"paragraphSize":"Regular","textWeight":"Regular","contentHorizontalAlignment":"Left","textHeadingSize":"None","maxWidth":"Default"}' class="text-style-regular body-max-width" data-bind='{"text":"paragraphText"}'>Progress that's tracked, celebrated and adjusted</p></li></ul></div></div><div class="button-group"><a data-cid="1g" data-props='{"buttonHierarchy":"Secondary","buttonSize":"Regular","buttonHasLeadingIcon":false,"buttonLeadingIcon":"category","buttonHasTrailingIcon":false,"buttonTrailingIcon":"arrow_forward","buttonLabel":"Meet the trainers","buttonLink":"/#4a525014-fd93-4826-996a-ce13a46ea734","$index":0,"$count":1}' class="button button-secondary" href="/#4a525014-fd93-4826-996a-ce13a46ea734" data-bind='{"attrs":{"href":"buttonLink"}}'><div style="margin: 0">Meet the trainers</div></a></div></div></div><div class="stack fill-height stack-center"><div class="r-1h"><div class="media-wrapper media-large aspect-square"><img class="media object-cover" src="/assets/443d932d-bf17-4bed-9afb-1477ffd7d297?v=tk9kk9" srcset="/assets/443d932d-bf17-4bed-9afb-1477ffd7d297-320?v=tk9kk9 320w, /assets/443d932d-bf17-4bed-9afb-1477ffd7d297-640?v=tk9kk9 640w, /assets/443d932d-bf17-4bed-9afb-1477ffd7d297-1280?v=tk9kk9 1280w, /assets/443d932d-bf17-4bed-9afb-1477ffd7d297?v=tk9kk9 1654w" sizes="100vw" alt="Athlete in a dark jacket stretches one leg on a concrete ledge at dusk beside a sports bag." style="aspect-ratio: 1654 / 951"></img></div></div></div></div></div></section></div>
  <div id="sc-feature-list-section-vertical" data-sid="1k" class="page-section"><section class="scheme-1 section"><div class="container"><div class="stack gap-section-content z-index-1"><div style="display: contents"><div class="stack"><div class="stack gap-element-tiny"><div class="row"><div class="tagline"><div>What you get</div></div></div><h2 data-cid="1n" data-props='{"headingTag":"H2","headingSize":"H2","headingText":"custom programing","contentHorizontalAlignment":"Left","maxWidth":"Default"}' class="heading-style-h2 heading-max-width" data-bind='{"text":"headingText"}'>custom programing</h2></div></div></div><div style="display: contents"><div class="grid-column-3"><div class="stack gap-element-large"><div class="row"><div class="r-1q"><div class="media-wrapper media-large media-width-fit"><img class="media object-cover" src="/assets/864770f1-3a05-4815-97c2-530e347a4784?v=tkau3x" srcset="/assets/864770f1-3a05-4815-97c2-530e347a4784-320?v=tkau3x 320w, /assets/864770f1-3a05-4815-97c2-530e347a4784-640?v=tkau3x 640w, /assets/864770f1-3a05-4815-97c2-530e347a4784?v=tkau3x 900w" sizes="100vw" alt="White Nike ReactX running shoe with turquoise accents and loose laces on a black rounded background." style="aspect-ratio: 900 / 900"></img></div></div></div><div class="stack gap-element-small"><div class="stack gap-element-tiny"><h4 data-cid="1s" data-props='{"headingTag":"H4","headingSize":"H4","headingText":"Community","contentHorizontalAlignment":"Left","maxWidth":"Default"}' class="heading-max-width heading-style-h4" data-bind='{"text":"headingText"}'>Community</h4></div><p data-cid="1t" data-props='{"paragraphText":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Training with a crew that keeps you honest and shows up for you. You&#39;ll train alongside people chasing the same goals, so the energy and support carry you still further."}]}]},"paragraphSize":"Regular","textWeight":"Regular","contentHorizontalAlignment":"Left","textHeadingSize":"None","maxWidth":"Default"}' class="text-style-regular body-max-width" data-bind='{"text":"paragraphText"}'>Training with a crew that keeps you honest and shows up for you. You'll train alongside people chasing the same goals, so the energy and support carry you still further.</p></div></div><div class="stack gap-element-large"><div class="row"><div class="r-1v"><div class="media-wrapper media-large"><img class="media object-cover" src="/assets/94bc3b29-ce35-4da3-81a3-977855aac168?v=tkau5h" srcset="/assets/94bc3b29-ce35-4da3-81a3-977855aac168-320?v=tkau5h 320w, /assets/94bc3b29-ce35-4da3-81a3-977855aac168-640?v=tkau5h 640w, /assets/94bc3b29-ce35-4da3-81a3-977855aac168?v=tkau5h 900w" sizes="100vw" alt="White sports water bottle with turquoise accents displayed diagonally on a dark rounded background." style="aspect-ratio: 900 / 900"></img></div></div></div><div class="stack gap-element-small"><div class="stack gap-element-tiny"><h4 data-cid="1x" data-props='{"headingTag":"H4","headingSize":"H4","headingText":"Nutrition Plans","contentHorizontalAlignment":"Left","maxWidth":"Default"}' class="heading-max-width heading-style-h4" data-bind='{"text":"headingText"}'>Nutrition Plans</h4></div><p data-cid="1y" data-props='{"paragraphText":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Meal-prepped plans built around your goals and the food you love. Every week you get a clear eating plan, so fuelling your training never becomes guesswork."}]}]},"paragraphSize":"Regular","textWeight":"Regular","contentHorizontalAlignment":"Left","textHeadingSize":"None","maxWidth":"Default"}' class="text-style-regular body-max-width" data-bind='{"text":"paragraphText"}'>Meal-prepped plans built around your goals and the food you love. Every week you get a clear eating plan, so fuelling your training never becomes guesswork.</p></div></div><div class="stack gap-element-large"><div class="row"><div class="r-20"><div class="media-wrapper media-large"><img class="media object-cover" src="/assets/36a4fb40-e7a3-4f4f-bd45-36a797634ae4?v=tkau6h" srcset="/assets/36a4fb40-e7a3-4f4f-bd45-36a797634ae4-320?v=tkau6h 320w, /assets/36a4fb40-e7a3-4f4f-bd45-36a797634ae4-640?v=tkau6h 640w, /assets/36a4fb40-e7a3-4f4f-bd45-36a797634ae4?v=tkau6h 900w" sizes="100vw" alt="White jump rope with two cyan-accented handles and coiled rope on a dark rounded background." style="aspect-ratio: 900 / 900"></img></div></div></div><div class="stack gap-element-small"><div class="stack gap-element-tiny"><h4 data-cid="22" data-props='{"headingTag":"H4","headingSize":"H4","headingText":"Progression","contentHorizontalAlignment":"Left","maxWidth":"Default"}' class="heading-max-width heading-style-h4" data-bind='{"text":"headingText"}'>Progression</h4></div><p data-cid="23" data-props='{"paragraphText":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Progress you can see and feel tracked week after week. We log your lifts and measurements so you always know you&#39;re getting stronger and moving forward."}]}]},"paragraphSize":"Regular","textWeight":"Regular","contentHorizontalAlignment":"Left","textHeadingSize":"None","maxWidth":"Default"}' class="text-style-regular body-max-width" data-bind='{"text":"paragraphText"}'>Progress you can see and feel tracked week after week. We log your lifts and measurements so you always know you're getting stronger and moving forward.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section></div>
  <div id="08ca38aa-d871-4b93-9811-3415a577bce5" data-sid="25" class="page-section"><section class="scheme-1 section-card"><div class="container"><div class="card card-backdrop bg-3ri1ua r-26"><div class="card-content-xlarge z-index-1"><div style="display: contents"><div class="stack"><div class="stack gap-element-tiny"><div class="row"><div class="tagline"><div>Nutrition, sorted</div></div></div><h2 data-cid="29" data-props='{"headingTag":"H2","headingSize":"H2","headingText":"Meal-prepped plans, ready every week","contentHorizontalAlignment":"Center","maxWidth":"Default"}' class="heading-style-h2 heading-max-width" data-bind='{"text":"headingText"}'>Meal-prepped plans, ready every week</h2></div><div class="stack gap-element-large"><div class="stack"><p data-cid="2a" data-props='{"paragraphText":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"No more guessing what to eat. Every week you get a meal-prepped plan built around your goals, your schedule, and the foods you actually enjoy — so the hardest part of eating well is already done for you."}]}]},"paragraphSize":"Regular","textWeight":"Regular","contentHorizontalAlignment":"Center","textHeadingSize":"None","maxWidth":"Default"}' class="text-style-regular body-max-width" data-bind='{"text":"paragraphText"}'>No more guessing what to eat. Every week you get a meal-prepped plan built around your goals, your schedule, and the foods you actually enjoy — so the hardest part of eating well is already done for you.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="backdrop-media-wrapper"><div class="r-2b"><div class="media-wrapper media-fill"><img class="media object-cover" src="/assets/9abc0b27-62a8-4789-af77-c01f92c29147?v=tk9kuq" srcset="/assets/9abc0b27-62a8-4789-af77-c01f92c29147-320?v=tk9kuq 320w, /assets/9abc0b27-62a8-4789-af77-c01f92c29147-640?v=tk9kuq 640w, /assets/9abc0b27-62a8-4789-af77-c01f92c29147-1280?v=tk9kuq 1280w, /assets/9abc0b27-62a8-4789-af77-c01f92c29147?v=tk9kuq 1515w" sizes="100vw" alt="Person holds an open compartmentalized lunchbox filled with broccoli, grains, chicken, salmon, and other food." style="aspect-ratio: 1515 / 1038"></img></div></div><div class="media-overlay-none"></div></div></div></div></section></div>
  <div id="4a525014-fd93-4826-996a-ce13a46ea734" data-sid="2e" class="page-section"><section class="scheme-1 section"><div class="container"><div class="stack gap-section-content z-index-1"><div style="display: contents"><div class="stack"><div class="stack gap-element-tiny"><div class="row"><div class="tagline"><div>Our trainers</div></div></div><h2 data-cid="1n" data-props='{"headingTag":"H2","headingSize":"H2","headingText":"Meet your coaches","contentHorizontalAlignment":"Left","maxWidth":"Default"}' class="heading-style-h2 heading-max-width" data-bind='{"text":"headingText"}'>Meet your coaches</h2></div></div></div><div style="display: contents"><div class="grid-column-3"><div class="stack gap-element-large"><div class="row"><div class="r-2h"><div class="media-wrapper media-large media-width-fit aspect-square"><img class="media object-cover" src="/assets/fc311397-0104-43a7-b75e-aba7e6135ec1?v=tkaujo" srcset="/assets/fc311397-0104-43a7-b75e-aba7e6135ec1-320?v=tkaujo 320w, /assets/fc311397-0104-43a7-b75e-aba7e6135ec1-640?v=tkaujo 640w, /assets/fc311397-0104-43a7-b75e-aba7e6135ec1?v=tkaujo 900w" sizes="100vw" alt="Portrait of a Black woman with long braids wearing a navy athletic jacket against a black background." style="object-position: top; object-fit: cover; aspect-ratio: 900 / 936"></img></div></div></div><div class="stack gap-element-small"><div class="stack gap-element-tiny"><h4 data-cid="1s" data-props='{"headingTag":"H4","headingSize":"H6","headingText":"Jessica Haywood","contentHorizontalAlignment":"Left","maxWidth":"Default"}' class="heading-max-width heading-style-h6" data-bind='{"text":"headingText"}'>Jessica Haywood</h4><div data-cid="2j" data-props='{"textContent":"Head Coach & Founder","textSize":"Regular","textWeight":"Regular","contentHorizontalAlignment":"Left","textHeadingSize":"None","textTrim":false,"textColorSource":"Token","maxWidth":"Default"}' class="text-style-regular scheme-heading" data-bind='{"text":"textContent"}'>Head Coach &amp; Fo