  <div id="sc-testimonial-list-vertical" data-sid="3i" class="page-section"><section class="scheme-2 section"><div class="container"><div class="stack gap-section-content z-index-1"><div style="display: contents"><div class="stack"><div class="stack gap-element-tiny"><div class="row"><div class="tagline"><div>Client results</div></div></div><h2 data-cid="1n" data-props='{"headingTag":"H2","headingSize":"H2","headingText":"Real people, real results","contentHorizontalAlignment":"Left","maxWidth":"Default"}' class="heading-style-h2 heading-max-width" data-bind='{"text":"headingText"}'>Real people, real results</h2></div><div class="stack gap-element-large"><div class="stack"><p data-cid="3j" data-props='{"paragraphText":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Here&#39;s what clients say about training with Curalo."}]}]},"paragraphSize":"Regular","textWeight":"Regular","contentHorizontalAlignment":"Left","textHeadingSize":"None","maxWidth":"Default"}' class="text-style-regular body-max-width" data-bind='{"text":"paragraphText"}'>Here's what clients say about training with Curalo.</p></div></div></div></div><div style="display: contents"><div class="grid-column-3"><div class="stack gap-element-medium"><p data-cid="2k" data-props='{"paragraphText":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Suspendisse varius enim in eros elementum tristique, at fermentum eros mi vitae diam."}]}]},"paragraphSize":"Medium","textWeight":"Regular","contentHorizontalAlignment":"Left","textHeadingSize":"None","maxWidth":"Default"}' class="body-max-width text-style-medium" data-bind='{"text":"paragraphText"}'>Curalo completely changed how I think about training. I'm stronger and more confident than I've ever been.</p><div class="row gap-element-horizontal-medium"><div class="row gap-element-horizontal-small"><img data-cid="3n" data-props='{"avatarSize":"Small","avatarPlacement":"None","avat